type: software
title: "Beam Research Toolkit"
version: "1.0.2"
date-released: "2026-09-07"
abstract: "Desktop application with an embedded Geant4 runtime for configuring particle-beam simulations, inspecting hits, trajectories and dose, and exporting results to DICOM RT Dose, CSV, JSON, ROOT, ParaView and VTU — without compiling Geant4."
